    <string name="settings_title">Settings</string>
    <string name="settings_about_title">About</string>
    <string name="settings_about_body">We Got Power turns the uncertainty of blackouts into clear data. It automatically records every battery charge: when it started, how much the level rose, how long you were on power, and how healthy the battery is by comparing its current capacity against the factory one. That way you make the most of every power window and quickly know whether the charge is actually working. Everything runs 100% on your phone, no internet or accounts needed: your information never leaves the device.</string>
